1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
第二部分先打开我们构建好的 image 看看
Part 2 opens the image we built;

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,480
这一段和下一段都是额外内容
this scene and the next are extras.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,923
首先是 docker image ls
First, docker image ls:

4
00:00:06,923 --> 00:00:14,123
录制时，磁盘占用 518 MB，内容大小 144 MB
518 megabytes on disk, and 144 megabytes of content, at the time of recording.

5
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:18,464
内容就是压缩后的那些层，也就是传到 registry 的部分
Content is the compressed layers that travel to a registry;

6
00:00:18,464 --> 00:00:20,373
磁盘占用还要加上解压后的那一份
disk adds the unpacked copy.

7
00:00:21,617 --> 00:00:24,817
然后 docker history 列出各层，最新的在最上面
Then docker history lists the layers, newest first.

8
00:00:25,137 --> 00:00:29,884
从下往上读，就是从上往下读 Dockerfile
Read it bottom-up, and it's the Dockerfile top-down:

9
00:00:29,884 --> 00:00:33,444
apt 和 pip 那一步 97.5 MB
the apt and pip step at 97.5 megabytes,

10
00:00:33,444 --> 00:00:38,556
我们的代码 250 KB，uv sync 125 MB
our code at 250 kilobytes, and uv sync at 125 megabytes.

11
00:00:38,876 --> 00:00:44,251
ENV、ENTRYPOINT、CMD 这几行都是 0 字节：只是配置
The ENV, ENTRYPOINT and CMD rows are zero bytes: config only.

12
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:49,423
它们下面是 base image 自己的几行
Below them sit the base image's own rows:

13
00:00:49,423 --> 00:00:51,830
最底下是 Debian bookworm
Debian bookworm at the bottom,

14
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:55,040
然后是把 /usr/local/bin 放在最前面的 PATH
the PATH that puts /usr/local/bin first,

15
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,640
还有 Python 3.12.15
and Python 3.12.15.

16
00:00:59,967 --> 00:01:02,666
想自己看的话，就再起一个 container
To look yourself, start a container again;

17
00:01:02,666 --> 00:01:05,236
这里显示的是我们第一部分第二次运行时的结果
these are from our second run in part 1.

18
00:01:05,556 --> 00:01:08,018
在那里，python 是 3.15.0
There, python is 3.15.0,

19
00:01:08,018 --> 00:01:12,020
而 base image 自带的 Python 还是 3.12.15
while the base Python is still 3.12.15.

20
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:17,042
那个 125 MB 的层，大部分就是这第二个 Python
Most of that 125 megabyte layer is this second Python,

21
00:01:17,042 --> 00:01:18,697
放在 uv 自己的目录里
in uv's own folder.

22
00:01:18,933 --> 00:01:20,533
现在列一下根目录
Now list the top folder.

23
00:01:20,853 --> 00:01:26,176
系统目录旁边有：隐藏的 .git 目录、编辑器的 .vscode 目录
Beside the system folders sit the hidden git folder, the editor's VS Code folder,

24
00:01:26,176 --> 00:01:28,213
还有 README 和你的 Dockerfile
the README and your Dockerfile.

25
00:01:28,533 --> 00:01:33,013
COPY 那一行复制了整个构建上下文，连你的 Git 历史也在里面
The COPY line copied the whole build context, your git history included.

26
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:35,595
输入 exit，回到你的笔记本
Type exit to get back to your laptop.

27
00:01:35,833 --> 00:01:39,438
这是教程里的一个缺口：没有 .dockerignore 文件
That's a gap in the tutorial: there's no .dockerignore file.

28
00:01:39,758 --> 00:01:41,292
在你自己的项目里
In your own projects,

29
00:01:41,292 --> 00:01:45,092
加一个这样的文件，写上 .git、.venv 和你的 secrets 目录
add one listing .git, .venv and your secrets folder.

30
00:01:45,412 --> 00:01:48,740
等 image 公开了，这一点最要紧，而它很快就会公开
It matters most once the image is public, and that's soon.

31
00:01:49,783 --> 00:01:52,170
那为什么 COPY 和 uv sync 又重跑了一遍
So why did COPY and uv sync rerun

32
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:54,050
明明我们只加了一行？
when we only added a line?

33
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:56,418
Docker 会缓存每一个构建步骤
Docker caches every build step.

34
00:01:56,738 --> 00:02:01,175
一个步骤，只要上一步和它的指令都没变，就会被重用
A step is reused when its parent step and its instruction are unchanged.

35
00:02:01,495 --> 00:02:04,951
对 COPY 来说，复制进来的文件，校验和也得一致
For COPY, the checksum of the copied files must match too.

36
00:02:05,271 --> 00:02:09,687
第一个变了的步骤会重新运行，它后面的每一步也一样
The first step that changes runs again, and so does every step after it.

37
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,331
什么都不改，再构建一次，加上那个看完整日志的额外参数
Rebuild with nothing changed, adding the extra flag for the full log.

38
00:02:14,651 --> 00:02:16,151
FROM 重用了 base image
FROM reuses the base,

39
00:02:16,151 --> 00:02:19,706
它后面的三步都显示 CACHED：什么都没跑
and the three steps after it all say CACHED: nothing runs.

40
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:21,265
先预测一下
Now predict.

41
00:02:21,315 --> 00:02:24,878
你改了 cli.py 里的一个词，然后重新构建
You change one word in cli.py and rebuild.

42
00:02:25,198 --> 00:02:27,087
四个构建步骤里，哪几个会重新运行？
Which of the four steps run again?

43
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,400
作为额外的一步，试试看
Try it, as an extra:

44
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:40,977
把第 49 行的 I love cheese 改成 I love brie
on line 49, change I love cheese to I love brie.

45
00:02:41,297 --> 00:02:45,905
用 git diff 能看到这处改动；现在构建上下文的校验和不一样了
The git diff shows the change; the build context now has a different checksum.

46
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:49,777
再构建一次。FROM，还有 apt 和 pip 那一步，都被重用了
Rebuild. FROM and the apt and pip step are reused.

47
00:02:50,097 --> 00:02:54,173
但复制进来的文件校验和变了，所以 COPY 会运行
But the checksum of the copied files changed, so COPY runs,

48
00:02:54,173 --> 00:02:57,350
它后面的 uv sync 也一样，连 Python 都要重新下载
and uv sync after it, Python download and all.

49
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,840
现在用 git checkout 撤销修改
Now undo the edit with git checkout.

50
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:02,485
文件一样了，缓存就回来了吗？
Same files, so the cache comes back?

51
00:03:02,805 --> 00:03:05,301
没有：COPY 和 uv sync 又跑了一遍
No: COPY and uv sync run again.

52
00:03:05,621 --> 00:03:09,612
Git 重写了它自己的 index 文件，就在隐藏的 .git 目录里
Git rewrote its own index file, inside the hidden git folder,

53
00:03:09,612 --> 00:03:12,490
而这个目录也在构建上下文里
and that folder is in the build context too.

54
00:03:12,733 --> 00:03:15,016
第一部分留下的问题，这下有答案了
That answers the question from part 1.

55
00:03:15,336 --> 00:03:18,191
你的 Dockerfile 也在构建上下文里
Your Dockerfile sits in the build context too,

56
00:03:18,191 --> 00:03:20,797
所以每改它一次，那个校验和就变一次
so every edit to it changed that checksum.

57
00:03:21,117 --> 00:03:24,466
你照着 README 一步步做的时候，这是正常的
While you follow the README step by step, that's expected.

58
00:03:24,716 --> 00:03:28,046
在你自己的项目里，把慢的步骤放前面
In your own projects, put the slow steps first:

59
00:03:28,046 --> 00:03:32,439
先只复制 uv sync 需要的文件，运行它，再复制其余的
copy only the files uv sync needs, run it, then copy the rest.

60
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:36,126
一个 .dockerignore 文件，可以把 .git 目录、本地的 venv
A .dockerignore keeps the git folder, any local venv

61
00:03:36,126 --> 00:03:37,726
还有 Dockerfile 都排除在外
and the Dockerfile out.

62
00:03:37,921 --> 00:03:42,551
这样一来，改 cli.py 只会让最后那个 COPY 重新运行
Now an edit to cli.py reruns only the last COPY.

63
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,329
现在进入 README 的这一节
Now the README section Pushing Docker Image to Docker Hub.

64
00:03:46,329 --> 00:03:48,576
Pushing Docker Image to Docker Hub
Now the README section Pushing Docker Image to Docker Hub.

65
00:03:48,896 --> 00:03:54,720
首先，注册账号，再建一个访问令牌，权限选读写，不要用默认的
First, sign up and create an access token, with read and write access, not the default.

66
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:59,541
马上复制：它只显示一次，作用和密码一样
Copy it right away: it's shown only once, and it works like a password.

67
00:03:59,861 --> 00:04:01,461
暂停一下，建好你自己的令牌
Pause and make yours.

68
00:04:01,517 --> 00:04:06,957
接着登录：docker login，-u 加你的用户名，-p 加你的令牌
Next, log in: docker login, -u with your user name, -p with your token.

69
00:04:07,277 --> 00:04:09,666
我们没有账号，所以没法跑
We have no account, so we couldn't run it.

70
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,853
所以有些步骤用了替身
So some steps use a stand-in,

71
00:04:11,853 --> 00:04:15,489
也就是本机上的一个小 registry：那些只看就好
a small registry on our own machine: just watch those.

72
00:04:15,809 --> 00:04:20,396
登录它时会警告：在命令行里写密码不安全
Logging in to it warns that a password on the command line is insecure.

73
00:04:20,633 --> 00:04:22,844
这是 README 的一个小疏漏
That's a small slip in the README:

74
00:04:22,844 --> 00:04:25,966
用 -p 的话，你的令牌会留在 shell 历史记录里
with -p, your token stays in your shell history.

75
00:04:26,286 --> 00:04:29,819
改成输入 docker login、-u 和你的用户名
Instead, type docker login, -u, and your user name,

76
00:04:29,819 --> 00:04:32,174
等它问的时候再粘贴令牌
then paste the token when it asks.

77
00:04:32,494 --> 00:04:33,983
暂停一下，登录
Pause and log in.

78
00:04:34,033 --> 00:04:36,550
然后给 image 打 tag：在 docker tag 后面先写
Then tag the image:

79
00:04:36,550 --> 00:04:41,862
simple-translate 再写你的用户名/simple-translate-ac215
docker tag simple-translate <USER NAME>/simple-translate-ac215.

80
00:04:42,182 --> 00:04:44,209
暂停一下，用你自己的用户名跑一遍
Pause and run it with your own name.

81
00:04:44,529 --> 00:04:47,874
额外用 docker image ls 看一下：两个名字，一个 ID
An extra docker image ls shows two names, one ID:

82
00:04:47,874 --> 00:04:49,649
是第二个名字，不是一份副本
a second name, not a copy.

83
00:04:49,883 --> 00:04:55,190
把这个长名字分成四段来读：registry，也就是默认的 docker.io
Read the long name in four parts: the registry, docker.io, the default;

84
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:58,928
你的账号；仓库；还有 tag，latest
your account; the repository; and the tag, latest.

85
00:04:59,248 --> 00:05:01,656
没有账号部分的名字，比如我们的第一个名字
Names without an account, like our first,

86
00:05:01,656 --> 00:05:03,050
都归在 library 下面
fall under library.

87
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,767
然后 push：docker push，用同一个名字
Then push: docker push, with the same name.

88
00:05:06,087 --> 00:05:07,509
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

89
00:05:07,559 --> 00:05:11,249
你那边应该会上传每一层，最后一行是 digest
Yours should upload each layer and end with a digest line.

90
00:05:11,569 --> 00:05:15,836
我们没有账号，被 Docker Hub 拒绝了：push access denied
Without an account, Docker Hub refused ours: push access denied.

91
00:05:16,156 --> 00:05:19,268
如果你也碰到了，就先登录，再检查令牌有没有写权限
If you see it, log in, and check your token can write

92
00:05:19,268 --> 00:05:21,617
名字是不是以你的用户名开头
and the name starts with your user name.

93
00:05:21,867 --> 00:05:25,591
在替身上，push 成功了，最后是一行 digest
On the stand-in, the push goes through, ending with a digest:

94
00:05:25,591 --> 00:05:27,605
整个 image 的指纹
a fingerprint of the whole image.

95
00:05:27,850 --> 00:05:32,287
再 push 一次：每一层都已经在了，只有缺的层才会传过去
Push again: every layer already exists, and only missing layers travel.

96
00:05:32,607 --> 00:05:33,671
在 Docker Hub 上
On Docker Hub,

97
00:05:33,671 --> 00:05:37,384
连 base image 的层也可能显示 Mounted from library/python
even the base layers may say Mounted from library/python:

98
00:05:37,384 --> 00:05:38,917
它本来就有这些层
it already has them.

99
00:05:38,967 --> 00:05:43,447
还要记住：新建的 Docker Hub 仓库默认是公开的
And remember: a new Docker Hub repository is public by default.

100
00:05:43,767 --> 00:05:46,156
谁都能 pull 它，连 .git 目录一起
Anyone can pull it, git folder and all.

101
00:05:48,483 --> 00:05:52,088
上 VM 之前再检查一项；这一段全是额外内容
One more check before the VM; this scene is all extras.

102
00:05:52,408 --> 00:05:58,126
我们的机器是 Intel 或 AMD 的，image 上写的是 linux/amd64
Our machine is Intel or AMD, and the image says linux/amd64.

103
00:05:58,446 --> 00:06:01,731
在 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 上，你会看到 arm64
On an Apple Silicon Mac, you'd see arm64.

104
00:06:01,966 --> 00:06:03,495
这为什么重要？
Why does that matter?

105
00:06:03,545 --> 00:06:07,824
一个 image 里的每个程序，bash、Python、uv
Every program in an image, bash, Python, uv,

106
00:06:07,824 --> 00:06:11,325
都是给某一种 CPU 用的机器码
is machine code for one kind of CPU:

107
00:06:11,325 --> 00:06:16,089
Intel 和 AMD 用 amd64，Apple Silicon 用 arm64
amd64 for Intel and AMD, arm64 for Apple Silicon.

108
00:06:16,409 --> 00:06:19,813
一个 container 里的程序直接跑在 CPU 上
A container's programs run directly on the CPU,

109
00:06:19,813 --> 00:06:25,027
所以除非有模拟器帮忙，CPU 得会说这个 image 的语言
so unless an emulator steps in, the CPU must speak the image's language.

110
00:06:25,347 --> 00:06:29,785
Docker Desktop 自带一个模拟器；普通的 Linux VM 没有
Docker Desktop has one built in; a plain Linux VM doesn't.

111
00:06:30,033 --> 00:06:33,297
一个 tag 可以指向一份菜单，每个平台一个 image
A tag can point at a menu, one image per platform.

112
00:06:33,617 --> 00:06:36,667
这个 python tag 列了五个平台
This python tag lists five platforms:

113
00:06:36,667 --> 00:06:40,294
amd64、两种 arm，还有两种比较少见的
amd64, two kinds of arm, and two rarer ones.

114
00:06:40,614 --> 00:06:43,196
Docker 会 pull 和你的机器对得上的那一行
Docker pulls the row that matches your machine.

115
00:06:43,433 --> 00:06:48,013
授课老师的 image，dlops/simple-translate
The instructor's image, dlops/simple-translate,

116
00:06:48,013 --> 00:06:51,326
不是菜单：只有一个 image，只有 amd64
is no menu: one image, amd64 only.

117
00:06:51,566 --> 00:06:54,311
我们在替身上 push 的是一份小菜单
Our stand-in push is a small menu:

118
00:06:54,311 --> 00:06:56,490
amd64，外加一个 attestation
amd64, plus an attestation,

119
00:06:56,490 --> 00:06:59,395
也就是这个 image 是怎么构建出来的记录
a record of how the image was built.

120
00:06:59,715 --> 00:07:05,134
如果是在 M 系列 Mac 上构建的，amd64 那一行就会变成 arm64
Built on an M-series Mac, the amd64 row would say arm64.

121
00:07:08,383 --> 00:07:09,677
来想一想
Now ponder.

122
00:07:09,727 --> 00:07:12,074
你在 M 系列 Mac 上构建，然后 push 了
You built on an M-series Mac and pushed.

123
00:07:12,394 --> 00:07:16,148
你的 VM 是一台普通的 Intel 或 AMD 机器
Your VM is an ordinary Intel or AMD machine.

124
00:07:16,468 --> 00:07:18,068
你的 image 在那儿能跑吗？
Will your image run there?

125
00:07:26,850 --> 00:07:27,850
不能
No.

126
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:33,426
这是反过来的同一个失败，发生在我们这台没有模拟器的机器上
Here's the same failure the other way around, on our machine, which has no emulator:

127
00:07:33,426 --> 00:07:34,885
exec format error
exec format error.

128
00:07:34,935 --> 00:07:37,730
换成 Docker Desktop，会直接把它模拟运行起来
Docker Desktop would just run it, emulated.

129
00:07:38,050 --> 00:07:41,641
Mac 上构建的 image 放到默认的 VM 上会这样失败
A Mac-built image on a default VM fails like this,

130
00:07:41,641 --> 00:07:43,724
或者报 no matching manifest
or with no matching manifest.

131
00:07:44,566 --> 00:07:46,742
有两个办法，README 里都没有
Two fixes, neither in the README.

132
00:07:47,062 --> 00:07:50,683
第一：为 VM 的平台构建
One: build for the VM's platform,

133
00:07:50,683 --> 00:07:54,742
加上 --platform 参数，设成 linux/amd64
with the flag --platform=linux/amd64.

134
00:07:55,062 --> 00:07:58,859
它就是 docker-shell.sh 的第 12 行，被注释掉了
It's the commented-out line 12 of docker-shell.sh.

135
00:07:59,179 --> 00:08:02,507
在 Mac 上，它是模拟运行的：慢一些，但能用
On a Mac, it runs emulated: slower, but it works.

136
00:08:02,827 --> 00:08:05,004
然后像之前一样，再打 tag、再 push
Then tag and push again, as before.

137
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:08,207
第二：docker-build-push.sh 用 buildx
Two: docker-build-push.sh uses buildx,

138
00:08:08,207 --> 00:08:10,697
也就是 Docker 的多平台构建器
Docker's multi-platform builder,

139
00:08:10,697 --> 00:08:13,186
两个平台都构建，再 push 一份菜单
to build both and push one menu.

140
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:18,992
在第 11 行填你的用户名
Put your user name on line 11,

141
00:08:18,992 --> 00:08:22,061
在第 7 行填 simple-translate-ac215
and simple-translate-ac215 on line 7,

142
00:08:22,061 --> 00:08:23,661
也就是 README 里的名字
the README's name.

143
00:08:23,881 --> 00:08:26,207
先登录，再用 bash 运行它
Log in first, then run it with bash.

144
00:08:26,527 --> 00:08:30,438
之后再切回来：docker buildx use default
Afterwards, switch back with docker buildx use default,

145
00:08:30,438 --> 00:08:32,926
在 Docker Desktop 上则是 desktop-linux
or desktop-linux on Docker Desktop.

146
00:08:33,967 --> 00:08:38,063
README 的最后一节：Running App on VM using Docker
The last README section: Running App on VM using Docker.

147
00:08:38,383 --> 00:08:41,135
首先，像第 1 讲那样创建一台 VM
First, create a VM, as in lecture 1.

148
00:08:41,455 --> 00:08:43,204
README 没给任何配置
The README gives no settings.

149
00:08:43,524 --> 00:08:48,561
一台普通的 E2 机器，装 Debian 12 或 13 就行
An ordinary E2 machine with Debian 12 or 13 will do;

150
00:08:48,561 --> 00:08:50,692
E2 机器都是 amd64
E2 machines are amd64.

151
00:08:51,012 --> 00:08:56,602
计价器开始跳了：VM 运行时按秒计费，它的磁盘只要还在就计费
The meter starts: the VM bills by the second while it runs, its disk while it exists.

152
00:08:56,867 --> 00:08:58,467
接着，SSH 进去
Next, SSH in.

153
00:08:58,702 --> 00:09:03,843
现在暂停：创建你的 VM，等到它的 SSH 终端打开
Pause now: create your VM, and wait until its SSH terminal is open.

154
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:08,004
然后安装 Docker：sudo apt install docker.io
Then install Docker: sudo apt install docker.io.

155
00:09:08,324 --> 00:09:09,746
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

156
00:09:09,796 --> 00:09:13,840
在我们的替身里，也就是一个软件包列表为空的全新 Debian
In our stand-in, a fresh Debian with empty package lists,

157
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,324
它失败了：Unable to locate package
it fails: Unable to locate package.

158
00:09:16,644 --> 00:09:19,695
如果你那边装好了，就直接跳到检查版本那一步
If yours installed, skip ahead to the version check.

159
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:21,779
README 的一个小缺口
A small gap in the README:

160
00:09:21,779 --> 00:09:25,859
这一节跳过了第 1 讲用过的 sudo apt-get update
this section skips sudo apt-get update, used in lecture 1.

161
00:09:26,179 --> 00:09:29,532
不跑它的话，软件包列表可能是空的，就像这里
Without it, the package lists may be empty, as here,

162
00:09:29,532 --> 00:09:31,982
也可能已经过期，会报 Not Found
or out of date, with Not Found errors.

163
00:09:32,302 --> 00:09:35,481
先跑 update，这是额外的一步，跑完先暂停
Run the update first, an extra, and pause after it.

164
00:09:35,734 --> 00:09:37,994
现在安装成功了
Now the install works:

165
00:09:37,994 --> 00:09:43,646
在 Debian 12 上是 92 个新软件包，下载 107 MB
92 new packages, a 107 megabyte download, on Debian 12;

166
00:09:43,646 --> 00:09:48,065
在 Debian 13 上是 91 个软件包，118 MB
91 packages and 118 megabytes on Debian 13.

167
00:09:48,385 --> 00:09:49,679
输入 Y
Answer Y.

168
00:09:49,729 --> 00:09:51,100
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

169
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:53,475
然后是 sudo docker --version
Then sudo docker --version.

170
00:09:53,795 --> 00:09:57,591
这是 Debian 自己打包的 Docker
This is Debian's own Docker package:

171
00:09:57,591 --> 00:10:04,867
录制时 Debian 12 上是 20.10.24，Debian 13 上是 26.1.5
20.10.24 on Debian 12, 26.1.5 on Debian 13, at the time of recording.

172
00:10:05,187 --> 00:10:07,428
比笔记本上的旧，但够用了
Older than the laptop's, but plenty.

173
00:10:07,684 --> 00:10:11,161
在这里，Docker 直接跑在 VM 的 Linux 内核上
Here Docker runs right on the VM's Linux kernel;

174
00:10:11,161 --> 00:10:15,001
没有隐藏的 VM，不像 Mac 上的 Docker Desktop
there's no hidden VM, unlike Docker Desktop on a Mac.

175
00:10:15,267 --> 00:10:16,689
那为什么要 sudo？
And why sudo?

176
00:10:16,739 --> 00:10:19,654
不加 sudo 的话，这个额外的 docker ps 会被拒绝
Without it, this extra docker ps is refused:

177
00:10:19,654 --> 00:10:22,238
访问 Docker socket 时 permission denied
permission denied on the Docker socket,

178
00:10:22,238 --> 00:10:24,888
socket 就是通往 Docker 后台服务的那扇门
the door to Docker's background service.

179
00:10:25,208 --> 00:10:27,982
只有 root 和 docker 组能打开它
Only root and the docker group may open it.

180
00:10:29,417 --> 00:10:31,187
然后是部署
Then the deploy:

181
00:10:31,187 --> 00:10:36,500
sudo docker run --rm -ti dlops/simple-translate
sudo docker run --rm -ti dlops/simple-translate.

182
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:38,242
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

183
00:10:38,292 --> 00:10:40,403
这台 VM 上还没有这个 image
The image isn't on this VM yet,

184
00:10:40,403 --> 00:10:42,786
所以 Docker 从 Docker Hub 把它 pull 下来
so Docker pulls it from Docker Hub,

185
00:10:42,786 --> 00:10:45,374
一共 7 层，然后启动一个 container
seven layers, then starts a container.

186
00:10:45,617 --> 00:10:49,651
现在用 python cli.py 运行这个应用，用它的默认设置
Now run the app with python cli.py and its defaults:

187
00:10:49,651 --> 00:10:52,444
I love cheese 翻成了意大利语
I love cheese comes back in Italian.

188
00:10:52,764 --> 00:10:54,186
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

189
00:10:54,236 --> 00:10:56,855
没有 clone，没有 pip，这台 VM 上也没有 uv
No clone, no pip, no uv on this VM:

190
00:10:56,855 --> 00:10:58,801
只有 Docker 和一个 image
just Docker and one image.

191
00:10:59,050 --> 00:11:05,450
再回到开头那个问题：为什么是 3.14.7，配方明明写的是 3.12？
And the opening question: why 3.14.7, when the recipe says 3.12?

192
00:11:05,770 --> 00:11:07,861
原因和我们那次构建一样
The same reason as in our build.

193
00:11:08,181 --> 00:11:13,406
这个 image 是 9 月 16 日构建的，用的是 uv 0.12.15
This image was built on September 16 with uv 0.12.15,

194
00:11:13,406 --> 00:11:19,914
当时 uv 知道的、范围内最新的稳定版 Python 是 3.14.7
and the newest stable Python that uv knew in the range was 3.14.7.

195
00:11:20,234 --> 00:11:23,221
我们今天构建得到的是 3.15.0
Our build today got 3.15.0.

196
00:11:23,467 --> 00:11:26,454
同一个 Dockerfile，相隔一个月，两个 Python
Same Dockerfile, a month apart, two Pythons.

197
00:11:26,774 --> 00:11:31,383
配方里什么都没 pin 住：pip 装的是最新的 uv
Nothing in the recipe is pinned: pip installs the latest uv,

198
00:11:31,383 --> 00:11:35,532
Python 的范围没有上限，这个 repo 里也没有 uv.lock
the Python range is open, and the repo has no uv.lock,

199
00:11:35,532 --> 00:11:37,760
所以每次构建都会自己写一个
so each build writes its own.

200
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:41,984
一个 image 会把这一切都冻结下来：要交付 image，而不是配方
An image freezes all that: ship the image, not the recipe.

201
00:11:42,234 --> 00:11:43,549
输入 exit
Type exit.

202
00:11:43,599 --> 00:11:45,190
还有一个小小的不一致
One more small mismatch:

203
00:11:45,190 --> 00:11:48,438
README 说要 pull 你 push 的那个 image
the README promises to pull the image you pushed,

204
00:11:48,438 --> 00:11:51,023
可这条命令跑的是授课老师的
but this command runs the instructor's.

205
00:11:51,343 --> 00:11:55,930
你的 image 是：你的用户名/simple-translate-ac215
Your image is <USER NAME>/simple-translate-ac215.

206
00:11:56,250 --> 00:12:00,538
用同一条命令运行它就行，前提是它已经为 amd64 构建好了
Run it with the same command, once it's built for amd64.

207
00:12:01,734 --> 00:12:06,677
额外检查一下还会发现，发布出来的 image 比 repo 落后
Also, an extra check shows the published image lags the repo:

208
00:12:06,677 --> 00:12:11,377
它的 cli.py 是旧版，没有把 raise exception 设为 True
its cli.py is the older one, without raise_exception=True.

209
00:12:11,697 --> 00:12:16,241
如果 Google 拒绝请求，那一版会悄悄把你的输入原样打出来
If Google refuses a request, that version quietly prints your input back.

210
00:12:16,561 --> 00:12:18,288
这不是 Docker 的问题
That's not a Docker problem.

211
00:12:18,534 --> 00:12:21,935
还有，如果 pull 这个 image 时报 toomanyrequests 失败了
And if pulling the image fails with toomanyrequests:

212
00:12:21,935 --> 00:12:26,774
Docker Hub 按网络地址限制匿名用户 pull 的次数
Docker Hub limits how often anonymous users can pull, per network address,

213
00:12:26,774 --> 00:12:28,475
一整个教室的人可能会碰到
which a classroom can hit.

214
00:12:28,795 --> 00:12:32,592
等一会儿，或者先登录：sudo docker login
Wait a while, or log in first, with sudo docker login.

215
00:12:33,833 --> 00:12:35,476
走之前，先清理一下
Before you go, clean up.

216
00:12:35,796 --> 00:12:38,936
额外检查 sudo docker ps -a
An extra check, sudo docker ps -a,

217
00:12:38,936 --> 00:12:43,369
没有留下任何 container，多亏了 --rm
shows no containers left behind, thanks to --rm.

218
00:12:43,633 --> 00:12:47,537
README 的最后一步：删除 VM，连同它的启动磁盘
Last README step: delete the VM, with its boot disk,

219
00:12:47,537 --> 00:12:51,590
然后确认 VM instances 和 Disks 两个页面都是空的
then check that VM instances and Disks are both empty.

220
00:12:51,910 --> 00:12:53,450
现在就暂停去做
Pause and do it now.

221
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,100
还有两件可选的杂事
Two optional chores.

222
00:12:55,228 --> 00:13:00,455
你的 Docker Hub 仓库会一直公开，直到你把它删掉或设成私有
Your Docker Hub repository stays public until you delete it or make it private.

223
00:13:00,775 --> 00:13:04,517
另外，想回收 image 在笔记本上占用的空间
And to reclaim the space your images take on the laptop,

224
00:13:04,517 --> 00:13:06,321
就运行：docker system prune -a
run docker system prune -a.

225
00:13:09,566 --> 00:13:12,809
第 1 讲给了我们一台装着 venv 的 VM
Lecture 1 gave us a VM with a venv inside.

226
00:13:13,129 --> 00:13:15,773
今天，container 插到了中间
Today a container slid in between:

227
00:13:15,773 --> 00:13:19,038
venv 现在住在一个 image 里，就在 /.venv
the venv now lives in an image, at /.venv.

228
00:13:19,358 --> 00:13:22,750
你在笔记本上构建了它，push 到 registry
You built it on your laptop, pushed it to a registry,

229
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:25,054
再在 VM 上用一条命令运行了它
and ran it on a VM with one command.

230
00:13:25,633 --> 00:13:27,638
五道自测题
Five questions to test yourself.

231
00:13:27,958 --> 00:13:32,171
第一题：image 和 container 有什么区别
One: what's the difference between an image and a container,

232
00:13:32,171 --> 00:13:33,996
--rm 又删掉了什么？
and what does --rm delete?

233
00:13:34,316 --> 00:13:37,422
第二题：我们的 container 启动时运行什么
Two: what does our container run at startup,

234
00:13:37,422 --> 00:13:41,868
如果在 image 名后面加上 python cli.py，又会怎样？
and what happens if you add python cli.py after the image name?

235
00:13:42,116 --> 00:13:46,055
第三题：Dockerfile 写的是 Python 3.12
Three: the Dockerfile says Python 3.12,

236
00:13:46,055 --> 00:13:50,095
那为什么 python 显示的是 3.15，或者 3.14？
so why does python report 3.15, or 3.14?

237
00:13:50,415 --> 00:13:52,954
第四题：你改了 cli.py 里的一行
Four: you edit one line of cli.py;

238
00:13:52,954 --> 00:13:57,433
哪些构建步骤会重新运行，你又会怎么调整 Dockerfile 的顺序？
which steps rerun, and how would you reorder the Dockerfile?

239
00:13:57,753 --> 00:13:58,753
第五题
Five:

240
00:13:58,753 --> 00:14:02,554
说出两种办法，让 Mac 上构建的 image 能在默认的 VM 上运行
name two ways to make a Mac-built image run on a default VM.

241
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:07,493
答案在练习里，每条命令都在学习指南里
The answers are in the exercises, and every command is in the study guide.

242
00:14:07,813 --> 00:14:11,828
下节课是容器 II：五个 container 协同工作
Next time, Containers 2: five containers working together,

243
00:14:11,828 --> 00:14:14,390
还有一个工作目录、一个非 root 用户
a working directory, a non-root user,

244
00:14:14,390 --> 00:14:17,989
以及把你笔记本上的目录挂载进 container
and your laptop's folder mounted inside a container.
